{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-16","kind":"proposition","title":"比例的交错变换","englishTitle":"If four magnitudes be proportional, they will also be proportional alternately.","book":5,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","contentId":"euclid-5-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfb2bf795ce1da3d67df5751509dccb80a98d3f20577d4329b4b630068e78dda","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-16.statement","euclid-5-16.construction.1","euclid-5-16.proof.1","euclid-5-16.proof.2","euclid-5-16.proof.3","euclid-5-16.proof.4","euclid-5-16.proof.5","euclid-5-16.proof.6","euclid-5-16.proof.7","euclid-5-16.proof.8","euclid-5-16.conclusion","euclid-5-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ee29409956160bafa7e912df55af1b9aee21aeeb01b6e5293527ffcdcb0da48","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four magnitudes be proportional, they will also be proportional alternately."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四级是成比例, 也会是成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f0b84f9039240f3f3dc5a11dd3f11432c96b51170d46f3e6f2a2471b7e5922c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C, D be four proportional magnitudes, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D; I say that they will also be so alternately, that is, as A is to C, so is B to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C,D等于4,成比例等,A比B等于C比D;我说,两者的交替性也很大,即A比C等于B比D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；A 与 C 之比等于 B 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f97f42fada278fd887ca99a0afcd547524b1cd3c00d3479856b3b910ed0cc2e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For of A, B let equimultiples E, F be taken, and of C, D other, chance, equimultiples G, H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B,同倍数,E,F被带走,C,D被带走,同倍数,G,H被带走。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b68a6f66b201f67a3481b4040d90a37ed21aa459390790d59737574e885dd3f9","citations":["euclid-5-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since E is the same multiple of A that F is of B, and parts have the same ratio as the same multiples of them, [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)] therefore, as A is to B, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E是A的乘数,F是B,零部件与B的乘数相同,因此,A对B的比等于E对F的比；A 与 B 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。 [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"125919afbbea7933d09632493405896e07a94ec74572139ad62a7263946738e8","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But as A is to B, so is C to D; therefore also, as C is to D, so is E to F. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对B的比等于C对D的比;因此,C对D的比等于E对F的比；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6796e1f5792d02ed849b1633bb52f131da014bbdaef373b31bed74b9b7278d3","citations":["euclid-5-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since G, H are equimultiples of C, D, therefore, as C is to D, so is G to H. [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自G以来,H占C中的同倍数,D占C,D占D,这相当于G占H；C 与 D 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。 [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f0f25f7a9365e785bce7352323aa1836924dd60f6ab249497a3779d0e250245","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to D, so is E to F; therefore also, as E is to F, so is G to H. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C对D的比等于E对F的比;因此,E对F的比等于G对H的比；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；E 与 F 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40e5486ab65e5fdb3b9220a712ca743c9e3a931ed68b7d1195bbb59221bdd189","citations":["euclid-5-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if four magnitudes be proportional, and the first be greater than the third, the second will also be greater than the fourth; if equal, equal; and if less, less. [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果四级为成比例, 前者大于第三级, 后者也将大于第四级; 如果等值, 等值; 如果差, 等值。 [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abfd1681ff319fa389b13520bedf782b3e64c4ac642d56c5ca94686a55126bdd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if E is in excess of G, F is also in excess of H, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果E多出G,F,如果相等,则等于或少于H。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4e6fcdabfe473afaecc6a122040003c9ea70fdb8e7f04c304ea70f19ce073df","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now E, F are equimultiples of A, B, and G, H other, chance, equimultiples of C, D; therefore, as A is to C, so is B to D. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在E,F是A,B中的同倍数,G,H中的其他机会是C,D中的同倍数;因此,A与C的比等于B与D的比；A 与 C 之比等于 B 与 D 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-16.source","contentId":"euclid-5-16","revisionId":"euclid-5-16@raw-bfb2bf795ce1da3d","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"874db1f9b19fc7cd8fe5e7ec4da82c1e7329a2eacc4d9a45b13eb27ea8eb2f97","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-16:euclid-5-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-16.proof.2","euclid-5-16.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"V. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-16:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5